  "img": "icons/svg/combat.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Spike Scale Worm Meat</strong><br> Once cooked this hard meet softens, when consumed turns the consumer to metal for one minute. While you are metal, You cannot float, and you cant be physically pushed against your will (You can be teleported and you are still affected by gravity). Your speed is set to 0. You have resistance to all damage and a minimum damage threshold of 15 (any damage below 15 does not hurt you after being halved). Your speed is set to 0,  but your momentum is tripled. Meaning You deal 3 times as much fall damage, This effect can be dispelled by dispel magic DC 16, but cannot be dismissed early by the user.</p>",
